  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Automate Telegram Messaging and Webhooks",
    "splashDescription": "This connector enables you to incorporate outbound bot operations (messaging, chat actions, media, and admin APIs) and inbound webhook-driven event triggers into Camunda-based business processes. It includes generated templates for start, intermediate catch, and boundary inbound events with correlation/output mapping options. This connector is developed independently and is not affiliated with or officially representing Telegram.",
